{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>藝人馮盈盈近年積極轉戰主持界，早前獲邀為國際醫學研討會晚宴擔任大會司儀，卻因一身極致性感的打扮引發網絡熱議。她穿上抹胸魚尾晚裝裙搭配透視薄紗，大方展露豐滿上圍及無瑕美背，令大眾目光完全無法移開。這身震撼眼球的破格造型背後，其實隱藏著一段與病患家庭息息相關的感人內情。</p>\n<h2>馮盈盈晚裝透視薄紗大展極致性感身段</h2>\n<p>馮盈盈於社交平台分享多張活動現場照片，畫面中她穿上一襲精心挑選剪裁貼身的抹胸魚尾晚裝裙，將豐滿上圍完全展露無遺。晚裝兩袖特別採用仙氣十足白色薄紗設計，胸前及腰間透視材質令肌膚若隱若現，轉身背對鏡頭時更大方展現白滑美背。這身散發強大氣場打扮極度吸睛，令現場氣氛瞬間升溫，成為全場視覺焦點。</p>\n<h2>馮盈盈親自發文親揭接下司儀重任內幕</h2>\n<p>面對外界對其性感打扮高度關注，馮盈盈親自在社交網發文剖白心聲，直言對能夠參與盛事深感榮幸。她指出這次活動主要協助國際專家與本地醫學領袖聚會交流，並在帖文中寫道：「這類交流能為病人爭取更多時間，為無數家庭帶來更多相聚時刻，意義重大！」她其後順利完成各項司儀環節，並上載多張幕後花絮照片。</p>\n<h2>美貌與智慧並重成功轉型穩坐金牌司儀</h2>\n<p>回顧這位港姐冠軍演藝之路，憑著優異學歷背景及出眾口才，近年積極轉戰主持界發展。憑藉美貌與智慧並重優勢，她頻頻獲邀出席各大商業機構隆重場合，擔任大型活動主持。這次她再度披上戰衣，接下國際級別醫學研討會司儀工作，現時已成為深得各大商業機構歡迎的主持人選。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚馮盈盈破格透視造型震撼眼球</h2>\n<p>這批性感與優雅並重活動花絮照片一經曝光，隨即在社交平台引發迴響。大批網民紛紛留言大讚她狀態大勇，有人驚嘆「完美演繹仙氣與性感」，亦有評論直指「透視設計真係震撼眼球」。除了討論其火辣外表，亦有粉絲留言支持她為病患家庭發聲的舉動，相關帖文至今仍持續吸引大量網民點讚及轉發。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368058786815904_7892641906ae964cc53dd5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"crystalfyy_1793537721_4020803833852489159_233098729.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368058786815904_7892641906ae964cc53dd5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@crystalfyy）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368059087449608_3971394186ae964cf26bed.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"crystalfyy_1793537721_4020803836419331783_233098729.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368059087449608_3971394186ae964cf26bed.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@crystalfyy）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368059444578772_10424017636ae964d2b9a72.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"crystalfyy_1793537721_4020803838701177262_233098729.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368059444578772_10424017636ae964d2b9a72.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@crystalfyy）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368059814793466_16170996756ae964d651bb0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"crystalfyy_1793537721_4020803840856881883_233098729.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368059814793466_16170996756ae964d651bb0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@crystalfyy）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368060147292426_15982548786ae964d9a25d7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"crystalfyy_1793537721_4020803843021242012_233098729.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368060147292426_15982548786ae964d9a25d7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@crystalfyy）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368060435652573_10703864746ae964dc82ec5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"crystalfyy_1793537721_4020803845982325450_233098729.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368060435652573_10703864746ae964dc82ec5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@crystalfyy）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T04:42:31.179589+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1093,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:36:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T04:59:34.816908+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:38:58.230335+00:00","content_hash":"4126f7a7553525dc9497df043dc41abbe6b07c610814c52fe0c1275257bd18f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}